Date: 2024-05-25
Num: 5
Issue: DMSITP143T OPERATION EXCEPTION OCCURRED AT DDBF52 IN SYSTEM ROUTINE
PIPMOD, RE-IPL CMS.

Missing function ABNEXIT.  PIPMOD sets up an ABEND handler via the ABNEXIT
SET function, but VM/370 CMS doesn't support ABNEXIT.

Test:
PLUNGER ENABLE

Fix:
Wrote an ABNEXIT nucleus extension in PLUFNC ASSEMBLE to trap program checks
and let PIPMOD try to recover.

TODO: Consider CMS mod to make all DMSABN calls go through the abend exit.

