Date: 2024-05-25
Num: 6
Issue: FPLINX410E ABEND 000000C1 at 00DD14CA; PSW 00E000C1 60DD14CA.

ABEND 000000C1 at 00DD14CA; PSW 00E000C1 60DD14CA.
... In FPLINXRN; offset 000002A2 in FPLINX 12/01/14 13.28.
... GPR0: 00000000 00000001 000007A5 00000013.
... GPR4: 00000000 1001000F 00F83108 00EF1518.
... GPR8: 00008938 00000000 0000A6C0 00EF12C8.
... GPRC: 00DD125C 00EF14A8 00000000 00008BE0.
... Store 00DD14C0: C25A41F0 82A81FEE 0BE016FE 50F072B8 9102D060.
DMSITP141T OPERATION EXCEPTION OCCURRED AT DD14CA IN ROUTINE PIPE.

PIPMOD uses BSM R14,0 without gating it by a test for 390 mode.

Test:
PLUNGER ENABLE
PIPE LITERAL x | CONSOLE

Fix:
Wrote ZAP002 in PLUZAP ASSEMBLE to NOP the BSM out, making the code think it's
not in 390 mode.

