Num: 7
Issue: Pipelines without system interfaces work.

Test:
REXXUNIT PIPBASIC

Examples:
PIPE LITERAL x | HOLE

PIPE LITERAL Hello world! | CONSOLE

PIPE (END ?)
   LITERAL A|LITERAL B|LITERAL a|LITERAL b| X: LOCATE /b/
   | CHANGE //1:/ | Y: FANINANY | CONSOLE
   ?X:|CHANGE //2:/ | Y:

