Date: 2024-09-16
Num: 11
Issue: Infinite loop getting WAITRD RC=2 from CONSOLE stage at start of pipeline.

CONSOLE stage uses WAITRD code=W to read from the console.  There's no
documentation about what it does, and VM/370 CMS doesn't support it.

Test:
PLUNGER ENABLE
PIPE CONSOLE | CONSOLE

Fix:
Implemented WAITRD in PLUFNC ASSEMBLE to wrap the WAITRD nucleus function and
replace code=W with code=T.

