Date: 2025-02-21
Num: 15
Issue: < (disk input) stage uses DMSFNSMC to close files.

VM/SP supported "DMSFNSMC" as a close command, similar to "FINIS".  Don't
know if there was any difference, but maybe something SFS-related?

Test:
PLUNGER ENABLE
PIPE < PIPEPREP EXEC A | CONSOLE

Fix:
Wrote DMSFNSMC wrapper in PLUFNC ASSEMBLE to call FINIS instead.

