Date: 2025-03-07
Num: 17
Issue: DMSSVT121S UNSUPPORTED SVC 204 (HEX CC) CALLED FROM D5FD68.

PIPDSK118E Return code 24 from renaming the file.
PIPMSG1167I Cannot load message repository .........
PIPMSG003I ... Issued from stage 2 of pipeline 1.
PIPMSG001I ... Running "> Z Z A".
DMSSVT121S UNSUPPORTED SVC 204 (HEX CC) CALLED FROM DF6A80.
PIPDSK727I RENAME Z Z A1 00008F78 CMSUT2 = ( NOUPDIR.

For unknown reasons, Pipelines has some SVC 204 (CMSCALL) uses in code paths
that are not post-SP5-only.

Test:
PLUNGER ENABLE
PIPE < PIPEPREP EXEC A | > Z Z A
PIPE < PIPEPREP EXEC A | > Z Z A

Fix:
Wrote SVC handler (SVC204) in PLUFNC ASSEMBLE to convert 204 to 202.

